      "id": "claim_a6b6d6c878b548f986289084fd1e83fa",
      "statement": "PNG-1544, a Jira story to increase the gpi Tracker batch frequency from 4h to 2h, was resolved as Won't Do on 2026-03-03 and recorded as Addendum A to PNG-TDD-6.0, citing projected Tracker API usage exceeding the contracted quota and recommending a change-feed-based internal service instead.",
