    {
      "id": "claim_38a053b8dcc745babf6c9be07fd01da0",
      "statement": "The 2026-09-08 Payments ARB session reaffirmed the quota/exposure constraint underlying PNG-1544's decision: GTRS (GTSI-0107) remains unfunded for 2026, and interim direct exposure of GPI_TRACKER_SNAPSHOT to channels was not approved, with the board noting a read-only, quota-isolated service would itself require ARB review.",
